Package: shampoo
Title: SHAMPOO: Scalable Hierarchical Assignment of Music Genres for POpular music Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Markus", "Radke", , "markus.radke@tu-berlin.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-1719-7060"))
Description: Implements a methodology for assigning popular music genres for multi-tagged corpora of popular music tracks. It creates a scalable hierarchical genre network and classifier to assign listener-centric categories to tracks in a transparent and reproducible way.
